{"title":"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 36","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In this figure the radius of the circle is equal to the altitude of the equilateral triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />. The circle is made to roll along the side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, remaining tangent to it at a variable point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> and intersecting lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/7/a179ff2638e4799cadd820db205c2beff6299ce9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> in variable points <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of degrees in arc <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/e/2ce038b1e5a705528e4dbf204157078937d1bb6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$MTN$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />, for all permissible positions of the circle:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/2/57205489915c25f75b3d81a0679b1fb7864ace63.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\text{varies from }30^{\\circ}\\text{ to }90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"197\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/5/4152a5057d26c78fd3df00b0181d68964c199d51.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B) }\\text{varies from }30^{\\circ}\\text{ to }60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"196\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/d/c6d357f8be3a069b6620a70c2109fffa2da3ffb0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C) }\\text{varies from }60^{\\circ}\\text{ to }90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"196\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/6/2/5620eb8e3a582611ec2a7094603c77cd2275130c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) }\\text{remains constant at }30^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"209\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/0/e108d13c8be50cc0712656ddfe5fe08a2cc0a5f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E) }\\text{remains constant at }60^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"207\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/a/c3ab85218dfc3f60dd6499948a1513946dbb2e69.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A = (0,0), B = (1,0), C = dir(60), T = (2/3,0); pair M = intersectionpoint(A--C,Circle((2/3,sqrt(3)/2),sqrt(3)/2)), N = intersectionpoint(B--C,Circle((2/3,sqrt(3)/2),sqrt(3)/2));  draw((0,0)--(1,0)--dir(60)--cycle); draw(Circle((2/3,sqrt(3)/2),sqrt(3)/2)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,dir(210)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,dir(-30)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,dir(90)); label(&quot;$M$&quot;,M,dir(190)); label(&quot;$N$&quot;,N,dir(75)); label(&quot;$T$&quot;,T,dir(-90));  [/asy]\" width=\"232\" height=\"252\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/0/1206dbf5135f666aeca5da6373124c460a6ceef4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] pair A = (0,0), B = (1,0), C = dir(60), T = (2/3,0); pair A2 = (0, sqrt(3)), B2 = (1, sqrt(3)), T2 = (2/3, sqrt(3)); pair M = intersectionpoint(A--C,Circle((2/3,sqrt(3)/2),sqrt(3)/2)), NN = intersectionpoint(B--C,Circle((2/3,sqrt(3)/2),sqrt(3)/2)); pair M2 = intersectionpoint(A2--C,Circle((2/3,sqrt(3)/2),sqrt(3)/2)), N2 = intersectionpoint(B2--C,Circle((2/3,sqrt(3)/2),sqrt(3)/2));   draw((0,0)--(1,0)--dir(60)--cycle); draw(C--A2--B2--cycle); draw(Circle((2/3,sqrt(3)/2),sqrt(3)/2)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,dir(210)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;,B,dir(-30)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,E); label(&quot;$M$&quot;,M,dir(190)); label(&quot;$N$&quot;,NN,dir(75)); label(&quot;$T$&quot;,T,dir(-90)); label(&quot;$A&#39;$&quot;,A2,dir(150)); label(&quot;$T&#39;$&quot;,T2,dir(90)); label(&quot;$B&#39;$&quot;,B2,dir(30)); label(&quot;$M&#39;$&quot;,M2,dir(170)); label(&quot;$N&#39;$&quot;,N2,dir(-75));   [/asy]\" width=\"212\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>Reflect <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> across a line through <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> parallel to line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/9/1090530ae883b627e090bfb5e450ef796febca40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/7/4c71f19552a05ee5e2b31e94aff3fb986884bf31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B&#39;$\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b4f897205beb16e266ea66d8ae8ece27cf5af8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M&#39;$\" width=\"23\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/065e6d116d16109a19d183a52f7714325b6be623.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N&#39;$\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/81366638e694deb1959c886bb89a07f71eff44a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T&#39;$\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be the reflections of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/1/5d1e4485dc90c450e8c76826516c1b2ccb8fce16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> across this line respectively.  By symmetry, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/3/4e39919f572d9421d9fe01d80321554dfafdeced.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A&#39;B&#39;$\" width=\"36\" height=\"14\" /> is tangent to the circle at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/81366638e694deb1959c886bb89a07f71eff44a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T&#39;$\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and arc <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/89152fde91cc80e7bc9aff2f0aec745bbba534e5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$M&#39;T&#39;N&#39;$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"65\" height=\"16\" /> also has measure <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/0/110f97e185d00f42474696fd7b0bf752e3c6aade.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" />.  \n</p><p>By the intersecting chords angle theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/9/669d22b82cecd44f8c875441aa33bd7dede04b40.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle MCN = \\frac{1}{2}(n^\\circ + n^\\circ) = n^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"219\" height=\"38\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is equilateral, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/a/8ea4f87dfd03f4300955e914559e75578ab17c82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 60$\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />.  Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/5/9d56dec7d563fe83e6bf7391e67da7f2de07cee4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{remains constant at }60^{\\circ}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"221\" height=\"30\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME\" title=\"1964 AHSME\">1964 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1964 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1964\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">Problem 35</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">Problem 37</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1964 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017164518\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.054 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.089 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 320/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2984/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 196/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8309/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion